{"games":[{"id":7881326119,"name":"Siren Head : The Forest","desc":"🌲 Welcome to \"Siren Head : The Forest\", a horror game set in a mysterious and haunted 🌲 forest. Players will need to navigate through the dense, dark woods while avoiding various monsters that roam the forest at night.\r\n───── ⋆⋅☆⋅⋆ ─────\r\nSome of the monsters you'll encounter include the Bridge Worm, Siren Head, Cartoon Cat, Cartoon Dog, Costume Man, Face Man, Choo Choo Charles, and Bones Worth, Doors, etc. Each of these creatures is unique and poses its own set of challenges for players to overcome.\r\n───── ⋆⋅☆⋅⋆ ─────\r\n💪 To help you survive, join the game's group to get 10% more health. For even more benefits, consider becoming a premium member. As a premium member, you'll receive buffs such as more health and a higher jump, giving you an edge in your fight against the forest's fearsome monsters.\r\n───── ⋆⋅☆⋅⋆ ─────\r\ninspired by The Rake By RVVZ and [SIREN HEAD] Cult Of The Cryptids\r\n","path":"/game/7881326119-siren-head-the-forest","slug":"7881326119-siren-head-the-forest","thumbnail":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/7aca7d4d4367a9516edc0c4748067f518dc34f99c4c7ffc03a13a409e89e2e47.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-23858ebfba0ac05ce20592d7a2ce01e8/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":8,"visitor":51732534,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2024-11-27T19:36:31.762Z","creator":{"name":"Siren Sounds","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":1,"freeCount":1,"keyCount":1,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":12736459172,"name":"Survive the Wave 🌊","desc":"","path":"/game/12736459172-survive-the-wave","slug":"12736459172-survive-the-wave","thumbnail":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/b253137f6ad66bfdc484711515b1bacc90b0870d85e485d35565ddbaabfaa1a0.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-b0cdebe4c4b550dec01a7a2c5af106fa/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":8,"visitor":0,"verified":false,"updatedAt":null,"creator":{"name":"Roblox","type":"User"},"script":{"count":0,"freeCount":0,"keyCo